<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>BP501T Medicinal Chemistry-II Question Bank</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --surface: #1e293b;
      --surface-hover: #26354d;
      --border: #334155;
      --text: #f8fafc;
      --text-muted: #94a3b8;
      --accent: #38bdf8;
      --high-bg: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.15);
      --high-border: #f43f5e;
      --high-text: #fda4af;
      --med-bg: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
      --med-border: #f59e0b;
      --med-text: #fcd34d;
      --low-bg: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);
      --low-text: #cbd5e1;
      --m10: #a855f7;
      --m5: #3b82f6;
      --m2: #10b981;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1280px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    }

    .badge-top {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
      color: var(--accent);
      border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 1.9rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    /* Controls Bar */
    .controls {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      background: var(--surface);
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .tabs {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .tab-btn {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .tab-btn:hover {
      color: var(--text);
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .tab-btn.active {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #0f172a;
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .search-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      align-items: center;
      flex: 1;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      min-width: 260px;
    }

    .search-input {
      background: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text);
      padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 320px;
      outline: none;
    }

    .search-input:focus {
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .toggle-label {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--high-text);
      cursor: pointer;
      user-select: none;
      background: var(--high-bg);
      border: 1px solid rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.35);
      padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    /* Section Styling */
    .mark-section {
      margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    }

    .section-header {
      padding: 1.15rem 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5);
    }

    .section-title {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .mark-pill {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.7rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .pill-10 { background: var(--m10); }
    .pill-5 { background: var(--m5); }
    .pill-2 { background: var(--m2); }

    .section-meta {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* Table Styling */
    .table-responsive {
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      text-align: left;
    }

    th {
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    th.special-col {
      background: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.12);
      color: var(--high-text);
      border-left: 2px solid var(--high-border);
      width: 32%;
    }

    td {
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      vertical-align: top;
      font-size: 0.93rem;
    }

    tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    tr:hover td {
      background-color: var(--surface-hover);
    }

    td.special-cell {
      border-left: 2px solid rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.35);
      background: rgba(244, 63, 94, 0.03);
    }

    .q-num {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 700;
      width: 55px;
    }

    .q-topic {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent);
      background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
      padding: 0.15rem 0.55rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    }

    .repeat-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.28rem 0.65rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .repeat-high {
      background: var(--high-bg);
      color: var(--high-text);
      border: 1px solid var(--high-border);
    }

    .repeat-med {
      background: var(--med-bg);
      color: var(--med-text);
      border: 1px solid var(--med-border);
    }

    .repeat-low {
      background: var(--low-bg);
      color: var(--low-text);
    }

    .repeat-note {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      th, td {
        padding: 0.75rem;
      }
      th.special-col {
        width: auto;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
  <header>
    <span class="badge-top">B. Pharmacy • Semester 5 • BP501T (M.Code: 76786)</span>
    <h1>Medicinal Chemistry-II Question Bank</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Arranged by Marks (10M, 5M, 2M) with a Dedicated Column for Most Repeated Questions (2019–2022 Papers)</p>
  </header>

  <div class="controls">
    <div class="tabs">
      <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="filterMarks('all', this)">All Sections</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" onclick="filterMarks('10', this)">10 Marks (Sec B)</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" onclick="filterMarks('5', this)">5 Marks (Sec C)</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" onclick="filterMarks('2', this)">2 Marks (Sec A)</button>
    </div>

    <div class="search-group">
      <label class="toggle-label">
        <input type="checkbox" id="repeatOnly" onchange="applyFilters()" />
        🔥 Show Most Repeated Only
      </label>
      <input
        type="text"
        id="searchInput"
        class="search-input"
        placeholder="Search drug, topic, or question..."
        oninput="applyFilters()"
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SECTION B: 10 MARKS -->
  <div class="mark-section" data-section="10">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-title">
        <span class="mark-pill pill-10">10 MARKS</span>
        <span>Section B — Long Answer Questions</span>
      </div>
      <span class="section-meta">Attempt any 2 out of 3 (2 × 10 = 20 Marks)</span>
    </div>
    <div class="table-responsive">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>#</th>
            <th>Question & Topic</th>
            <th class="special-col">🔥 Most Repeated Status & Frequency</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">B1</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Local Anaesthetics</span><br />
              Describe the detailed SAR, classification, and mechanism of action of Local Anaesthetics. Give the synthesis and MOA of <strong>Procaine</strong>.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ MOST REPEATED (3x in 10M | 6x Total)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Asked in 2022, 2021 & 2020 (10M); also repeated in 5M (SAR of benzoic acid derivatives) & 2M (Procaine synthesis).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">B2</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Antineoplastic Agents</span><br />
              Classify Antineoplastic agents with one structural example of each category. Give the synthesis and MOA of <strong>Mercaptopurine</strong> (and usage of plant products in cancer).
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ MOST REPEATED (3x in 10M | 4x Total)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Asked in 2022, 2020 & 2019 (10M); classification also repeated in 2021 (5M).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">B3</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Steroids & Corticosteroids</span><br />
              (a) Comment upon the nomenclature and stereochemistry of steroidal drugs.<br />
              (b) Discuss in detail the chemistry of <strong>corticosteroids</strong>, sex hormones, and synthetic progesterones (or drugs used in CHF).
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ MOST REPEATED (3x in 10M | 5x Total)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Asked in 2022, Paper 3 & 2019 (10M); also repeated in 2021, 2020 & 2019 (5M).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">B4</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Antihypertensives & Loop Diuretics</span><br />
              Discuss the development of <strong>ACE inhibitors</strong> and <strong>Loop Diuretics</strong>. Give the chemical name, synthesis, uses, and MOA of <strong>Methyldopa / Methyldopate HCl</strong> and <strong>Furosemide</strong>.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ MOST REPEATED (3x in 10M | 5x Total)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Asked in Paper 3, 2020 & 2019 (10M); Methyldopa synthesis & ACE inhibitors also in 2022 (2M).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="false">
            <td class="q-num">B5</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Antihistaminic Agents</span><br />
              Define and classify H<sub>1</sub> and H<sub>2</sub> receptor antagonists with suitable examples. Give the mode of action, synthesis, and therapeutic uses of <strong>Triprolidine Hydrochloride</strong>.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-med">Asked 1x in 10M (4x in 5M)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Asked in 2021 (10M); H<sub>1</sub> & H<sub>2</sub> antagonists frequently appear in Section C (5M).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="false">
            <td class="q-num">B6</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Diuretics</span><br />
              Define and classify diuretic drugs. Give the mode of action and synthesis of <strong>Acetazolamide</strong> and <strong>Chlorthiazide</strong>.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-med">Asked 1x in 10M (3x in 5M)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Asked in 2021 (10M); Chlorthiazide synthesis (2020) & Carbonic anhydrase inhibitors (2022, 2019) in 5M.</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="false">
            <td class="q-num">B7</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Antiarrhythmic Drugs</span><br />
              Classify Antiarrhythmic agents giving MOA and structure of at least one drug from each category. Outline the synthetic procedure of <strong>Disopyramide phosphate</strong>.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-med">Asked 1x in 10M (3x in 5M)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Asked in Paper 3 (10M); repeated in 2022, 2021 & 2019 as 5M questions.</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SECTION C: 5 MARKS -->
  <div class="mark-section" data-section="5">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-title">
        <span class="mark-pill pill-5">5 MARKS</span>
        <span>Section C — Short Answer Questions</span>
      </div>
      <span class="section-meta">Attempt any 7 out of 9 (7 × 5 = 35 Marks)</span>
    </div>
    <div class="table-responsive">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>#</th>
            <th>Question & Topic</th>
            <th class="special-col">🔥 Most Repeated Status & Frequency</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">C1</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Gastric Proton Pump Inhibitors</span><br />
              What are <strong>Proton Pump Inhibitors (PPIs)</strong>? Give their structures, mechanism of action, therapeutic uses, and examples.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ MOST REPEATED (3x in 5M | 4x Total)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Asked in 2022, 2021 & Paper 3 (5M); Lansoprazole also asked in 2019 (2M).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">C2</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Antianginal Agents</span><br />
              Write a detailed note on the role of <strong>Calcium Channel Blockers</strong> used in the treatment of Angina Pectoris.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ MOST REPEATED (3x in 5M)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Exact question repeated in 2022, Paper 3 & 2020 (5M).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">C3</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Thyroid & Antithyroid Drugs</span><br />
              Briefly describe the chemistry of <strong>Thyroid hormones</strong>, their synthetic derivatives, and thyroid drugs used in hypothyroidism.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ MOST REPEATED (3x in 5M | 4x Total)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Asked in 2022, 2021 & Paper 3 (5M); also in 2020 (2M MCQ).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">C4</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Congestive Heart Failure (CHF)</span><br />
              Write a note on the chemistry and structures of <strong>Cardiac Glycosides</strong> and drugs used in Congestive Heart Failure (CHF).
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ MOST REPEATED (3x in 5M | 6x Total)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Asked in 2021, Paper 3 & 2020 (5M); also in 2019 (10M) and Digitalis in 2022 & Paper 3 (2M).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">C5</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Antiarrhythmic Drugs</span><br />
              Classify <strong>Antiarrhythmic agents</strong> with examples of each class. Give the MOA and synthesis of <strong>Disopyramide phosphate</strong>.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ MOST REPEATED (3x in 5M | 4x Total)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Classification in 2022 & 2019 (5M); Disopyramide in 2021 (5M); combined in Paper 3 (10M).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">C6</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">H1-Receptor Antagonists</span><br />
              Give the structural classification of <strong>H<sub>1</sub>-antagonists</strong>, synthesis of <strong>Promethazine</strong>, and a note on second-generation H<sub>1</sub> antagonists.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ MOST REPEATED (3x in 5M | 4x Total)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Promethazine + classification in 2022 & 2020 (5M); 2nd-gen H1 in 2019 (5M); 10M in 2021.</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">C7</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Antihyperlipidemic Agents</span><br />
              Write a short note on <strong>HMG-CoA reductase inhibitors</strong> (Statins).
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ REPEATED (2x in 5M | 3x Total)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Exact question in 2022 & 2019 (5M); Lovastatin structure & MOA in 2021 (2M).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">C8</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Antidiabetic Agents</span><br />
              Write a short note on <strong>Glucosidase inhibitors</strong> as antidiabetic agents and give the synthesis of <strong>Tolbutamide</strong>.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ REPEATED (2x in 5M | 3x Total)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Exact question in 2022 & 2020 (5M); glucosidase role & inhibitor in 2019 (2M).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">C9</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Diuretics</span><br />
              Discuss in detail the chemistry of <strong>Carbonic Anhydrase Inhibitors</strong>.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ REPEATED (2x in 5M | 4x Total)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Exact question in 2022 & 2019 (5M); Acetazolamide in 2021 (10M) & site of action in 2020 (2M).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">C10</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Coagulants & Anticoagulants</span><br />
              Give a brief account of <strong>Anticoagulants</strong> with examples. Draw structures of any four anticoagulants including <strong>Warfarin</strong>.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ REPEATED (2x in 5M | 3x Total)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Asked in 2022 & 2020 (5M); phenindione derivative asked in 2019 (2M).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">C11</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Steroids & Corticosteroids</span><br />
              Explain the <strong>stereochemistry, nomenclature, and metabolism of steroids</strong>, and structural features of <strong>glucocorticoids and mineralocorticoids</strong>.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ REPEATED (4x in 5M | 7x Total)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Steroid stereochemistry in 2021 & 2019 (5M); Corticosteroids in 2021 & 2020 (5M) + 3x in 10M.</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">C12</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">H2-Receptor Antagonists</span><br />
              Write a note on <strong>H<sub>2</sub>-antagonists</strong>. Draw structures of any three H<sub>2</sub>-antagonists and give the synthesis of any one.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ REPEATED (2x in 5M | 3x Total)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Asked in Paper 3 & 2020 (5M); also part of 10M question in 2021.</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">C13</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Local Anaesthetics</span><br />
              Classify <strong>Local Anaesthetic agents</strong> and give the SAR of <strong>benzoic acid derivatives</strong> acting as anaesthetic agents.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ REPEATED (2x in 5M | 5x Total)</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Asked in Paper 3 & 2019 (5M); also asked 3 times in Section B (10M).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">C14</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Antineoplastic Agents</span><br />
              Give the MOA and synthesis of <strong>Methotrexate</strong>, classification of antineoplastics, and usage of <strong>plant products</strong> in cancer treatment.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-high">★ REPEATED Across Sections</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Methotrexate synthesis in 2019 (5M) & 2022 (2M); Plant products in Paper 3 (5M) & 2019 (10M).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="true">
            <td class="q-num">C15</td>
            <td>
              <span class="q-topic">Antihypertensives & Diuretics</span><br />
              Outline the synthesis and uses of <strong>Clonidine</strong>; describe <strong>Thiazide diuretics</strong> with synthesis of <strong>Chlorthiazide</strong>; explain <strong>alpha and beta blockers</strong> in hypertension.
            </td>
            <td class="special-cell">
              <span class="repeat-badge repeat-med">Repeated Across Sections</span>
              <span class="repeat-note">Clonidine in Paper 3 (5M) & 2022/2020 (2M); Chlorthiazide in 2020 (5M) & 2021 (10M).</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr data-repeated="false">
            <td class="q-num">C16</td>
